  "title": "Roman-Style Tripe",
  "description": "Tender beef tripe is simmered low and slow, then finished in a zesty marinara sauce made with a unique combination of pancetta, mint, and garbanzo beans.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-05-14T14:53:36-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-19T06:28:04-04:00",
